[1mA — artifacts[22m ([38;5;10mtranslation/SYMBOLS.md[0m, [38;5;10mERRORS.md[0m, [38;5;10mCONFIGS.md[0m): 16 symbols mapped, 48 error rows, 60 configuration rows, all derived by grepping the C for its actual branches. No symbol was missing from the Rust [38;5;10m.so[0m, so no module needed translating.[0m[0m
[0m[0m
